    en: 'Scan the labels of ALL packs there in one go, then press the button below. Each item scanned takes exactly the number of packs just scanned (replacing its old number).',
  },
  nhieuDot: { vi: 'Muốn quét làm nhiều đợt, cộng dồn? ', en: 'Want to scan in several rounds and add them up? ' },
